{
  "title": "Nearly Home",
  "hook_type": "warning",
  "cards": [
    {
      "text": "Don't look when Dad says \"nearly home.\"",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557770712-d450ba95f9cd?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "kKn-pSzhYfI",
      "photo_credit": "Bence Balla-Schottner"
    },
    {
      "text": "On night drives as a kid, he'd whisper it from the back seat, right beside me.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603638725730-233a04d9dca4?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "8scIRgeyRpE",
      "photo_credit": "Brecht Denil"
    },
    {
      "text": "But Dad was driving. I could hear him humming at the wheel.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1780615835963-c52dfc857769?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "QBYbVDk1yuM",
      "photo_credit": "Ed Parker"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Keep them shut, love,\" it whispered, its breath cold on my cheek. \"Nearly home.\"",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583054994298-cc68ddaca862?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "-CaVJXYhx4U",
      "photo_credit": "Soop kim"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every trip, the drive home took longer, and the humming got louder.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758806470137-4927af62958e?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "cH0vK61lwtM",
      "photo_credit": "Yauheni Hancharenka"
    },
    {
      "text": "One night, the car stopped, and the driver's door clicked open.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574172528634-a26851ca0b4b?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "iJORyAu3qk0",
      "photo_credit": "Christopher Farrugia"
    },
    {
      "text": "Footsteps crunched around to my door, and the humming leaned in close.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1782969958554-6b48b33fa9c2?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "MwAVzRzB8VI",
      "photo_credit": "argelis disla"
    },
    {
      "text": "I opened my eyes. Dad's smiling face filled my window, deep in black trees.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621840090029-08b00c831808?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "hg-AQfzQr20",
      "photo_credit": "Sasha Matic"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside me, Dad whispered, \"Now it knows.\"",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1642268565002-729f4e3dad5b?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "Hm1F6EBNA70",
      "photo_credit": "Marcel Strauß"
    }
  ],
